```


If `id` and `name` arguments are provided, look for a column with such an id and update its name and value.

Expression:
```
esaggs index={indexPatternLoad id="90943e30-9a47-11e8-b64d-95841ca0b247"} 
  aggs={aggHistogram id="a" enabled=true schema="segment" field="bytes" maxBars=34 interval="auto" has_extended_bounds=false min_doc_count=false}
  aggs={aggSum id="b" enabled=true schema="metric" field="bytes"} metricsAtAllLevels=false partialRows=false
| head 1
| staticColumn id="col-1-b" name="New name" value="23213FFF"
```

Result of the `staticColumn` expression:
```JSON
{
  "type": "datatable",
  "columns": [
    {
      "id": "col-0-a",
      "name": "bytes",
      "meta": {
        "type": "number",
        "field": "bytes",
        "index": "kibana_sample_data_logs",
        "params": {
          "id": "number"
        },
        "source": "esaggs",
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "col-1-b",
      "name": "New name",
      "meta": {
        "type": "string",
        "field": "bytes",
        "index": "kibana_sample_data_logs",
        "params": {
          "id": "string"
        },
        "source": "esaggs",
      }
    }
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "col-0-a": 0,
      "col-1-b": "23213FFF"
    }
  ]
}
```


If no `id` and `name` arguments are provided, expression throws an error: 

Expression:
```
esaggs index={indexPatternLoad id="90943e30-9a47-11e8-b64d-95841ca0b247"} 
  aggs={aggHistogram id="a" enabled=true schema="segment" field="bytes" maxBars=34 interval="auto" has_extended_bounds=false min_doc_count=false}
  aggs={aggSum id="b" enabled=true schema="metric" field="bytes"} metricsAtAllLevels=false partialRows=false
| head 1
| staticColumn value="23213FFF"
```
or 
```
| staticColumn  id=null value="23213FFF"
```
or 
```
| staticColumn  name=null value="23213FFF"
```
or 
```
| staticColumn  name='' value="23213FFF"
```
or 
```
| staticColumn  id='' value="23213FFF"
```
or both are null/empty string.

Result of the `staticColumn` expression:
```
staticColumn > 'id or name have to be provided'
```

## Synopsis

Этот PR реализует макрос `extern_dart!`, который генерирует код для функций регистрации Dart функций, а также обертки для вызова этого кода.

Рефакторинг кодовой базы Jason'а под использование нового макроса, будет произведен в отдельном PR'е.

### Текущий синтаксис макроса

```rust
// Code will be generated in the 'peer_connection' module, also you can
// control visibility of this module with visibility
// modifier ('pub').
//
// Module name will be used as a prefix for register functions.
#[extern_dart]
mod peer_connection {
    use std::{
        ptr,
        os::raw::c_char,
    };

    use dart_sys::Dart_Handle;

    extern "C" {
        // This documentation will be injected to the generated
        // extern function caller:

        /// Creates new offer in the provided `PeerConnection`
        ///
        /// Returns created SDP offer.
        fn create_offer(peer: Dart_Handle) -> ptr::NonNull<c_char>;

        /// Creates new answer in the provided `PeerConnection`
        ///
        /// Returns created SDP answer.
        fn create_answer(peer: Dart_Handle) -> ptr::NonNull<c_char>;
    }
}

```




